#: admin/bgr-welcome-page.php:19
msgid ""
"BuddyPress Group Reviews enables members to add reviews for groups and "
"provide multiple ratings based on predefined criteria. All submitted "
"reviews appear in the group’s \"Manage Review\" section, where admins can "
"approve or deny them. Approved reviews are published and displayed in the "
"\"Reviews\" tab on the group page. Admins have the flexibility to add as "
"many rating criteria as needed."
